# 1. YOUR ROLE AND MAIN OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, Solana blockchain engineer, UI/UX designer, security engineer, database architect, and AI integration specialist.

Build a complete, modern, production-structured application called **Veri-Fi**.

Veri-Fi is a social betting and challenge platform where users can discover people, create friendly bets, challenge one another, chat privately, participate in different challenge categories, submit evidence, resolve outcomes, and securely receive winnings through Solana-powered escrow.

The application should combine:

- Social networking and user discovery.
- Peer-to-peer challenges and friendly betting.
- Secure Solana smart-contract escrow.
- In-app wallet balances.
- Private external wallet connections.
- Automatic winner payouts after authorized resolution.
- Private real-time messaging.
- Referral rewards and points.
- An AI assistant called VeriBot.
- A complete administrative dashboard.

Build an actual working application, not just a visual prototype.

Do not remove existing working features, replace functional logic with mock data, or create buttons that do nothing.

Where an external service requires credentials, build the complete integration structure, provide clear environment-variable instructions, and report exactly what still needs configuration.

