- View their complete transaction history.

### App Wallet dashboard

Display:

- Total balance.
- Available balance.
- Locked balance.
- Pending balance.
- Deposit button.
- Withdraw button.
- Send button.
- Receive button.
- Transaction history.

Every balance movement must be reflected in an auditable financial ledger.

Do not use localStorage or an ordinary frontend state variable as the source of financial truth.

The backend must enforce balance updates, transaction validation, authorization, idempotency, reconciliation, and accounting controls.

The application must prevent double spending, duplicate deposits, duplicate withdrawals, and unauthorized balance changes.

## B. PRIVATE USER WALLET

Allow users to connect external Solana wallets, including:

- Phantom.
- Solflare.

Users should be able to:

- Connect their private wallet.
- Disconnect their wallet.
- Verify wallet ownership through a signed message.
- Deposit SOL into their Veri-Fi App Wallet.
- Withdraw SOL from their App Wallet to their private wallet.
- View their wallet address.
- Open transaction details on Solana Explorer.

Never request or store a user's seed phrase or private key.

Never pretend that a wallet is connected when it is not.

Never display a successful transaction until the transaction has been properly verified.

